  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Hunted and badly hurt, Gu Yue Fang Xiang activates sleep lurk Gu to conceal himself after sacrificing other Gu worms. This rank four Gu worm has outstanding concealment effects on par with rank five, and he has used it many times to escape fierce threats. It has a weakness: once activated, the Gu Master falls into deep sleep, and the deeper the sleep, the better the concealment. He loses sensation of the outside world. After he has slept for some time, the Gu breaks apart into pieces, yet pursuers still miss him when Twelfth Hair uses an immortal killer move on him. When he wakes and checks his aperture, sleep lurk Gu has already shattered, and he judges that it lasted until the crucial moment so he could escape.",
